# Theia AQP MCP Integration

- Use `docs/aqp-monorepo-paths.md` for AQP paths.
- DataMCP and CodebaseMCP are AQP-owned surfaces; Theia consumes them
  through configured HTTP/API clients.
- Do not import from `agentic_quant_platform` source into Theia extension
  code.
- Keep AQP-specific behavior inside `theia-extensions/aqp/`.

